TY  - GEN
ID  - 1172-5
TI  - Optimistic calculations about the Witten-Reshetikhin-Turaev invariants of closed three-manifolds obtained from the figure-eight knot by integral Dehn surgeries
DA  - D:20080313
AB  - I calculate optimistically asymptotic behaviors of the WRT $SU(2)$ invariants for the three-manifolds obtained from the ﬁgure-eight knot by p- surgeries with $p=0,1,2,$ $\ldots,$ $10$ , from which one can extract volumes and the Chern-Simons invariants of these closed manifolds. I conjecture that this also holds for general closed three-manifolds.
ER  - 
